#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoder-8-channel-standalone-encoder.rst:54
#: 54cce4956fb24d3cb828a5b85ad9df65
msgid "Re-Programming the Atmega328p PPM encoder"
msgstr "重新编程 Atmega328p PPM 编码器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoder-8-channel-standalone-encoder.rst:56
#: a6ab1d2c96b54b1e923072c4997f4cad
msgid ""
"**Note**: !The PPM Encoder comes with the PPM encoder firmware pre-"
"programmed, and most users will never need or want to modify it. However, "
"some users may want to get into the code to change the way the PPM Encoder "
"interprets RC signals or may want to update to the latest version. Some rare"
" users did report receiver compatility problems with the old version (before"
" ArduPPM). For most cases, ArduPPM did solve them.   ArduPPM is the official"
" name for the newer generation firmwares. It has been designed from scratch "
"with reliability as a top priority. The official release of the encoder "
"firmware is in the Downloads section as ArduPPM_Vx.x.xx_ATMega328p.hex. The "
"official source code is in the `Git repository here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/ArduPPM>`__. The "
"standalone PPM Encoder needs the ATMega328p version.   To flash, connect the"
" PPM Encoder to an AVR programmer such as the AVRISP mkII:"
msgstr ""
"**注意**：PPM 编码器出厂时已预装了 PPM 编码器固件，大多数用户永远不需要修改它。但某些用户可能希望修改代码以改变 PPM 编码器解析 RC "
"信号的方式，或更新到最新版本。少数用户报告与旧版本（ArduPPM 之前）存在接收机兼容性问题，在大多数情况下，ArduPPM "
"已解决了这些问题。ArduPPM 是新一代固件的官方名称，从头设计，以可靠性为首要目标。编码器固件的官方版本以 "
"ArduPPM_Vx.x.xx_ATMega328p.hex 发布在下载区。官方源代码在 `Git 仓库 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/ArduPPM>`__ 中。独立 "
"PPM 编码器需要 ATMega328p 版本。如需刷写，请将 PPM 编码器连接到 AVR 烧录器（如 AVRISP mkII）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ppm-encoder-8-channel-standalone-encoder.rst:73
#: dce917fad0b6434c9118dbc2ca35b52e
msgid ""
"When flashing, make sure the PPM Encoder is powered using any of the 5V and "
"Ground pins."
msgstr "刷写时，请确保 PPM 编码器通过任一 5V 和地引脚供电。"

